<title>USA: Dimon Inc expects favorable Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Dimon Inc expects favorable Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>DANVILLE, Va. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dimon Inc said on Tuesday it expects results for the third quarter that compare favorably with those from the same period last year.</p>
<p>Total tobacco inventories were up at year's end, but the uncommitted portion had declined, to $55 million from $77 million at the same point the year before.</p>
</text>
